WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:10.120
In this lesson, you will learn to put several blocks inside a repeat to make longer patterns, like dances and walks around shapes.

2
00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:14.370
A repeat can hold many blocks.

3
00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:15.840
All of them repeat, in order.

4
00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:22.310
Look for the part that repeats — the chunk.

5
00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:26.370
Put the chunk inside the repeat.

6
00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:28.990
Right, down, left, up is a square.

7
00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:32.010
Repeat it to walk round again!

8
00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:34.260
A dance chunk might be: hop, grow, shrink.

9
00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.480
Repeat it for a dance!

10
00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:43.740
Climb the stairs and hop on each step: right, up, hop — 3 times.

11
00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:45.900
A three-block chunk, repeated 3 times!

12
00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:50.090
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

13
00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:56.430
Now build along, then try the challenges. You’ve got this!
